{"version":1,"content":"<p>【神人 😱】有外國玩家為徹底擺脫 NVIDIA 12V-2x6 / 12VHPWR 16-Pin 的燒卡惡夢，特別為自己的 GeForce RTX 5090 顯示卡打造出一款專屬轉換模組，成功將供電介面更換為 4 組傳統 PCIe 8-Pin 接頭。</p><p>該方案不僅能避開容易過熱的 16-Pin 介面，更讓每條導線的電流負載近乎減半，實測運作溫度更大幅降低約 20°C。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T18:00:13.173436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:57:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:17:36.352386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T17:57:50.587600+00:00","content_hash":"b6460c0f44233a09ccc64032810f1ea05195eb61bc4fc6a1e81377d45df492e0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}